strator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"},{"page":5,"title":"Boy crying","illustrator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"},{"page":6,"title":"Boy lookng for something in a pile","illustrator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"},{"page":7,"title":"Boy pushing a sofa and carrying a stool","illustrator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"},{"page":8,"title":"Old lady holding a yo-yo","illustrator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"},{"page":9,"title":"Old lady playing with a yo-yo","illustrator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"},{"page":10,"title":"Boy hugging old lady holding a yo-yo","illustrator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"},{"page":11,"title":"Boy and old lady playing with a yo-yo","illustrator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"},{"page":12,"title":"Boy looking upset and old lady playing with a yo-yo on a rocking chair","illustrator":"Sukhada Rahalkar","holder":"Pratham Books","year":"2014"}],"retrieved":"2026-09-16"},"pages":[{"n":1,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p01.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಅಲ್ಲೂ ಇಲ್ಲ, ಇಲ್ಲೂ ಇಲ್ಲ.","ನೀನೆಲ್ಲಿ ಕಾಣೆ?"]},{"n":2,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p02.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಸೋಫಾದ ಮೇಲೂ ಇಲ್ಲ.","ಮಂಚದ ಕೆಳಗೂ ಇಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":3,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p03.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಪೆಟ್ಟಿಗೆ ಒಳಗೂ ಇಲ್ಲ.","ತಂಗಿಯ ಲಂಗದ ಕೆಳಗೂ ಇಲ್ಲ."]},{"n":4,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p04.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ತಲೆ ದಿಂಬಿನ ಕೆಳಗೂ ಇಲ್ಲ.","ನನ್ನ ಬ್ಯಾಗಿನಲೂ ಇಲ್ಲ.","ಅಳು ಬರುತಿದೆ,","ನೀನೆಲ್ಲಿ ಕಾಣೆ?"]},{"n":5,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p05.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ನಾನು ಎಲ್ಲಾ ರೂಮಲ್ಲಿಯೂ ಹುಡುಕಿದೆ,","ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಪುಸ್ತಕವನ್ನೂ ತಡಕಿ ನೋಡಿದೆ.","."]},{"n":6,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p06.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ನಾನು ಕುರ್ಚಿಯ ಕೆಳಗೂ ಹುಡುಕಿದೆ,","ನಾನು ಸ್ಟೂಲಿನ ಕೆಳಗೂ ನೋಡಿದೆ.","ನೀನೆಲ್ಲಿ ಕಾಣೆ?"]},{"n":7,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p07.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಸ್ವಲ್ಪ ಹೊತ್ತಿನಲೇ ಅಜ್ಜಿ,","ವಾಕಿಂಗ್ ಮುಗಿಸಿ ಬಂದಳು.","\"ನೋಡು, ಪಾರ್ಕಿನಲಿ ನನಗೆ ಏನೋ ಸಿಕ್ಕಿತು!\""]},{"n":8,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p08.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["\"ಇದು ತೂಗುವುದು,","ಇದು ಜಿಗಿವುದು.","ಇದು ಗಿರ ಗಿರ ತಿರುಗುವುದು,","ಇದು ನೇತಾಡುವುದು.\""]},{"n":9,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p09.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["\"ಹ... ಹ್ಹ... ಹ್ಹಾ! ಹ... ಹ್ಹ... ಹ್ಹಾ!\"","ಓ ಅಜ್ಜಿ! ನೀನೆಷ್ಟು ಒಳ್ಳೆಯವಳು!","ನೀನು ನನ್ನಿಷ್ಟದ ಆಟಿಕೆ 'ಯೋ-ಯೋ' ಹುಡುಕಿದೆ!"]},{"n":10,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p10.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["\"ಯೋ-ಯೋ? ಅಂತಲಾ, ಇದೆಂಥಾ ಹೆಸರಪ್ಪ!","ನಾನೂ ಇದರೊಂದಿಗೆ ಆಟ ಆಡಬೇಕು,","ಇದರ ಆಟ ನನಗೆ ಮಜಾ ಕೊಡುತಿದೆ! \""]},{"n":11,"image":{"src":"/data/picturebooks/359-kaleditthu-matte-sikkitu/p11.jpg","width":708,"height":339},"text":["ಕಿಲ ಕಿಲ, ಕಿಲ ಕಿಲ ನಗುತ್ತಾ,","ಅಜ್ಜಿ ನನ್ನ ಆಟಿಕೆ ಹಿಡಿದು,","ದಿನ ಪೂರ್ತಿ ಆಡಿದಳು!"]}],"wordCount":111}